{"round":"after-cycle-011","model":"Kokoro-82M v1.0","channels":{"ebola":{"file":"ebola.m4a","period":30.022,"digest":"a5eb6a65428bbfa3","cues":[{"t":0.0,"d":12.46,"text":"The Bundibugyo strain of Ebola in eastern Congo: 9,277 confirmed cases and 4,478 deaths by 14 October."},{"t":13.01,"d":2.54,"text":"That is more than twice the cases of early August."},{"t":16.11,"d":3.76,"text":"Kenya reported its first imported case on 6 October."},{"t":20.42,"d":2.41,"text":"No licensed vaccine exists for this strain."},{"t":23.38,"d":2.9,"text":"In Kenya, contact tracing is still done on paper."}]},"el-nino":{"file":"el-nino.m4a","period":29.797,"digest":"01472c95193fb0b8","cues":[{"t":0.0,"d":4.8,"text":"NOAA puts the central Pacific at 2.1 degrees above normal."},{"t":5.35,"d":5.26,"text":"A strong to very strong El Niño is likely into early 2027."},{"t":11.16,"d":6.15,"text":"The odds of a historic peak of 2.5 degrees stand at 70 to 83 percent."},{"t":17.86,"d":7.76,"text":"It lands on oceans that set a record in September, a month 1.63 degrees above pre-industrial."}]},"cop31":{"file":"cop31.m4a","period":39.285,"digest":"b30b913b846f53f4","cues":[{"t":0.0,"d":6.92,"text":"COP31 meets in Antalya from 9 to 20 November."},{"t":7.47,"d":10.96,"text":"Current policies lead to about 2.8 degrees this century, full national pledges to about 2.6."},{"t":18.98,"d":8.71,"text":"The lowest path that overshoots 1.5 degrees needs cuts of 18 percent by 2030."},{"t":28.24,"d":2.46,"text":"The pledges deliver 5 to 8."},{"t":31.25,"d":3.42,"text":"Finance and adaptation remain stalled."}]},"wildlife":{"file":"wildlife.m4a","period":27.251,"digest":"1e1aaace27fe0fea","cues":[{"t":0.0,"d":5.41,"text":"The Living Planet Index records an average decline of 73 percent since 1970."},{"t":5.96,"d":7.76,"text":"It rests on 35,803 population trends of 5,790 vertebrate species."},{"t":14.27,"d":3.15,"text":"95 percent in Latin America and the Caribbean."},{"t":17.98,"d":2.1,"text":"85 percent in fresh water."},{"t":20.63,"d":1.58,"text":"That is what is monitored."}]},"diseases":{"file":"diseases.m4a","period":36.12,"digest":"d23b302e65162a01","cues":[{"t":0.0,"d":12.78,"text":"The EU and EEA recorded 1,715 West Nile infections and 130 deaths by 7 October, the most ever reported there."},{"t":13.33,"d":10.78,"text":"Nigeria counted 16,997 suspected cases of diphtheria and 596 deaths by week 34."},{"t":24.66,"d":5.99,"text":"How much of this is climate, and how much is lost surveillance and vaccination, is still open."}]},"displaced":{"file":"displaced.m4a","period":25.438,"digest":"1639cde97ff8624f","cues":[{"t":0.0,"d":9.0,"text":"UNHCR counts 117.3 million people forcibly displaced at mid-2025."},{"t":9.55,"d":3.87,"text":"67.8 million of them inside their own countries."},{"t":13.97,"d":2.5,"text":"It calls that figure likely an underestimate."},{"t":17.02,"d":2.52,"text":"It covers only 38 reporting countries."}]},"ai-vote":{"file":"ai-vote.m4a","period":27.602,"digest":"c7b2b29020d7d27a","cues":[{"t":0.0,"d":9.48,"text":"Before the American vote of 3 November, the Wesleyan Media Project counted 220 political ads made at least partly with AI."},{"t":10.03,"d":3.07,"text":"They cost over 137 million dollars."},{"t":13.65,"d":2.48,"text":"In 2024 it was under 50,000."},{"t":16.69,"d":2.46,"text":"27 percent carry an AI disclaimer."},{"t":19.7,"d":1.58,"text":"No federal rule requires one."}]},"first-rung":{"file":"first-rung.m4a","period":22.831,"digest":"2bb2506339fbb3f9","cues":[{"t":0.0,"d":8.52,"text":"Workers aged 22 to 25 in the occupations most exposed to AI stand 19 percent below their less exposed peers."},{"t":9.07,"d":2.05,"text":"A year earlier the gap was 13 percent."},{"t":11.66,"d":1.39,"text":"It comes from fewer hires."},{"t":13.61,"d":2.46,"text":"Where is skill learnt once the entry job is gone?"}]},"power-bill":{"file":"power-bill.m4a","period":28.025,"digest":"ae3541a810109ad0","cues":[{"t":0.0,"d":4.37,"text":"Data-centre electricity rose 17 percent in 2025."},{"t":4.92,"d":2.67,"text":"AI-focused data centres rose 50 percent."},{"t":8.14,"d":8.95,"text":"The International Energy Agency projects 485 terawatt-hours doubling to about 950 by 2030."},{"t":17.64,"d":3.2,"text":"Where operators do not report, the footprint is not known."}]},"iran":{"file":"iran.m4a","period":37.53,"digest":"64ddaf69e93cf5bc","cues":[{"t":0.0,"d":5.26,"text":"Iran declared a prohibited zone around the Strait of Hormuz on 6 September."},{"t":5.81,"d":3.47,"text":"No large ship had passed since early September."},{"t":9.83,"d":9.17,"text":"The IMF sees 4.7 percent inflation in 2026, hardest for energy importers outside the technology chain."},{"t":19.55,"d":10.36,"text":"In the Philippines, which imports about 98 percent of its oil from the Middle East, a state think tank estimates 1.3 to 3.1 million people pushed into poverty."}]}},"rest":{"file":"rest.m4a","period":150.0,"margin":0.3,"from":"2026-10-26","to":"2026-11-01","voices":8,"cues":[{"t":0.1,"d":2.07,"text":"Ballon d'or 2026","v":6},{"t":0.22,"d":2.74,"text":"Die Geschichte vom Brandner Kaspar","v":7},{"t":0.43,"d":3.04,"text":"Akku.scm 1.2.0 released","v":2},{"t":0.74,"d":1.71,"text":"Inés Gómez Mont","v":3},{"t":1.01,"d":0.66,"text":"bytemail","v":4},{"t":1.64,"d":1.71,"text":"Fernando Gómez-Mont Urueta","v":0},{"t":2.15,"d":0.9,"text":"Carmen Luvana","v":4},{"t":2.22,"d":0.94,"text":"Max Liebermann","v":1},{"t":2.4,"d":0.59,"text":"Treap","v":5},{"t":2.99,"d":1.01,"text":"zizou bergs","v":6},{"t":3.26,"d":1.24,"text":"Liste étudiante","v":3},{"t":3.31,"d":1.42,"text":"Juca Kfouri","v":5},{"t":3.61,"d":0.67,"text":"saltcoats","v":1},{"t":3.73,"d":0.7,"text":"reloj","v":0},{"t":3.91,"d":2.71,"text":"Hasan Piker sues Scott Jennings for defamation","v":4},{"t":3.93,"d":4.89,"text":"Horoscope for Saturday, 10/31/26 by Christopher Renstrom","v":7},{"t":4.31,"d":1.69,"text":"Temu: Shop Like a Billionaire","v":6},{"t":4.33,"d":1.28,"text":"Allerheiligen","v":2},{"t":5